{"4563590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pig King", "steam_appid": 4563590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4881940], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/948113950e7ef2a6771c9ffe986522f1.poster.avif?t=1783933606\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/948113950e7ef2a6771c9ffe986522f1.webm?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/948113950e7ef2a6771c9ffe986522f1.mp4?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAY ON TOP TO WIN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players will fight it out, through multiple rounds, in the pig arenas. Use any weapon, tool or snout to take out your opponents. First one to reach 10 eliminations will sit on the throne as the new Pig King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/c6c326d04f29aa574a109cf77f679725.poster.avif?t=1783933606\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/c6c326d04f29aa574a109cf77f679725.webm?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/c6c326d04f29aa574a109cf77f679725.mp4?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity guns, goo guns, shotguns and rockets. The arenas will provide all your standard pig arena weaponry. We wouldn’t want you to miss your meat hammer, now would we? Break open a weapon box and see what fresh hell awaits your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/ae26efa7640cb3045da7d0660ab053fb.poster.avif?t=1783933606\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/ae26efa7640cb3045da7d0660ab053fb.webm?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/ae26efa7640cb3045da7d0660ab053fb.mp4?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE ARENAS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t forget to look around. The arenas might have some special tricks to give you the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/45a7ae4616a79ef91fe8f3c7c068bf4e.poster.avif?t=1783933606\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/45a7ae4616a79ef91fe8f3c7c068bf4e.webm?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/45a7ae4616a79ef91fe8f3c7c068bf4e.mp4?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIPSTICK ON A PIG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your appearance with hats and more. Unlock items as you play. When they see that shower cap coming for them, they’ll know to be afraid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feature list:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety in weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/948113950e7ef2a6771c9ffe986522f1.poster.avif?t=1783933606\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/948113950e7ef2a6771c9ffe986522f1.webm?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/948113950e7ef2a6771c9ffe986522f1.mp4?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STAY ON TOP TO WIN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players will fight it out, through multiple rounds, in the pig arenas. Use any weapon, tool or snout to take out your opponents. First one to reach 10 eliminations will sit on the throne as the new Pig King.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/c6c326d04f29aa574a109cf77f679725.poster.avif?t=1783933606\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/c6c326d04f29aa574a109cf77f679725.webm?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/c6c326d04f29aa574a109cf77f679725.mp4?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gravity guns, goo guns, shotguns and rockets. The arenas will provide all your standard pig arena weaponry. We wouldn’t want you to miss your meat hammer, now would we? Break open a weapon box and see what fresh hell awaits your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/ae26efa7640cb3045da7d0660ab053fb.poster.avif?t=1783933606\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/ae26efa7640cb3045da7d0660ab053fb.webm?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/ae26efa7640cb3045da7d0660ab053fb.mp4?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE ARENAS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t forget to look around. The arenas might have some special tricks to give you the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/45a7ae4616a79ef91fe8f3c7c068bf4e.poster.avif?t=1783933606\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/45a7ae4616a79ef91fe8f3c7c068bf4e.webm?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/extras/45a7ae4616a79ef91fe8f3c7c068bf4e.mp4?t=1783933606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIPSTICK ON A PIG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your appearance with hats and more. Unlock items as you play. When they see that shower cap coming for them, they’ll know to be afraid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feature list:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety in weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The battle for the pig throne has begun! Fight your way to the top in this arena party brawler for up to 4 players.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/0ef2ce97a07047ecb8bbf12a281d711ede8c4a9b/header.jpg?t=1783933606", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/a518c106059eef7b3b6c808f84770758d0d47596/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783933606", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563590/a518c106059eef7b3b6c808f84770758d0d47596/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783933606", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700K 4.0GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GTX 1060 / AMD RX 480<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> A controller is recommended to play this game.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["TwoPeaks"], "publishers": ["TwoPeaks", "Isle of Strays"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "ma